A `## Not a heading` line inside a fenced code block isn't listed, so `# Top` runs to the end of the file with only `## Real` inside it.
== args
input/fenced.md
== file input/fenced.md
# Top
```md
## Not a heading
```
## Real
== stdout
input/fenced.md (5 lines)
[L1-L5] # Top
[L5-L5] ## Real
== stderr
== exit 0
